# draftplate.part -- A round along ellipses where a drafted block meets a round
# Copyright (c) 2026 Jakob Kastelic

# A block 40 x 20 drafted 3 deg along y, and a plate across it whose
# top front edge, seen from the side, is a round of 5 (a cylinder along
# x).  The drafted sides of the block meet that cylinder on ellipses;
# the edge where they meet gets a round of 1.  Where the round along an
# ellipse runs on into the one along the line of the top, the two share
# the ball that touches the top on its seam with the cylinder, not the
# one square to the line through the corner, which the draft tilts.
profile b along y -20 -10 0 20 -10 0 20 10 0 -20 10 0
extrude box from 0 to -30 b draft 3
profile w along x 5 -15 0 5 5 0 -20 5 5 -20 -15 0
extrude plate from -25 to 25 w
common part box plate
round 1 box.side plate
